# Herrendoerfer et al. (2018, 2017JB015225) comparison geometry.
#   domain              150 x 150 km, gravity 0, P = 5 MPa held by a constant
#                       side traction (bc.stress_bc_x0/x1 = 1)
#   band                250 m thick at z = -75 km, 1 cells across (250 m each)
#                       elem_band_width per cell = 176.8 m (71% of the cell)
#   velocity weakening  x = 32 to 108 km (76 km)
#   transitions         4 km each, 8 material steps per side
#   host                elastic (cohesion 1e50), shells coarsening away
# Region areas are multipliers on std_elem_size = 1.5 * resolution^2; use
# mesh.resolution = 250 and mesh.meshing_option = 91.

